WEBVTT

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:25.170
Saint Seiya

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:33.830
Beyond tens of billions of light years.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.760
Past immense darkness.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.150
The world you reach upstream
the Acheron River.

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:48.070
The infinite pasture near the Lethe River.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:54.940
The utopia only those chosen
by God can enter after death.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.910
Where there is no hunger,
war, suffering or sadness.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:05.670
A haven of eternal peace free from evil.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:09.970
It is called Elysion.

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.020
Wait, Ikki.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.070
If you go after Shiryu and the others

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:29.570
your body will also be blown away.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:35.250
I heard the Phoenix Cloth has regenerative
powers and is able to resurrect.

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:39.670
But that Cloth has not been
blessed by the blood of Athena.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.300
That's true.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:45.130
But I must go.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.210
I will let you go to Elysion.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:54.890
In exchange, get revenge. Please, Ikki.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:03:04.190
Gods of Death and Sleep

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:08.180
Phoenix has entered the other
side of the Wailing Wall?

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:11.910
And I heard Miss Pandora was with him.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.370
Are they trying to escape to Elysion?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.380
But why Miss Pandora?

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:18.860
I can't believe it.

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:22.030
Anyway, take care of Phoenix first.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:26.320
He's already taken a lance to
his back. He's almost done.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.320
Finishing him off will be easy.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.130
Get revenge?

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:35.050
My eyes have been opened.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:42.080
Thirteen years ago, my family
was murdered for Lord Hades.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:48.120
Pandora, are you saying your
body was used like Shun's?

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:51.850
It was 13 years ago,

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.460
the Hades Castle on Earth.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:04:00.750
I was born and raised there,
surrounded by nature.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.930
It was called Heinstein Castle.

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:10.090
My family, the Heinsteins, were
bright and peaceful back then.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.250
With a kind father, mother

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:19.600
and many servants, my childhood was blessed.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:25.190
However, one day I awakened
evil with my own hands.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:28.480
Wait, Adolf! Where are you going?

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:31.920
What's wrong, Adolf?

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:35.250
You can't go over there,
Father will scold us.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:40.570
Father had always warned
me never to go there.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:44.900
It was a shed, all the way
in the back of the garden.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:49.830
The doors were said to have not
been opened for over 200 years.

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:56.680
But the sturdy lock had popped
open by an invisible force.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:03.480
And I, as if possessed by a demon,

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.230
stepped into the shed.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:16.490
There only was a small, sealed
chest with "Athena" written on it.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:20.480
When I opened the chest foolishly,

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.660
that was the beginning of the end.

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:32.920
Pandora, we thank you for releasing
us after over 200 years.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:35.280
Who are you?

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:39.330
I am God of Sleep, Hypnos.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.690
I am God of Death, Thanatos.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.650
Hypnos and Thanatos?

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.820
Listen, Pandora.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:52.680
Soon Lord Hades' soul will
resurrect as your little brother.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:57.040
Lord Hades, as my little brother?

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:00.960
Yes. Through your mother's body,

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.630
the ruler of the Underworld
will resurrect on Earth.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:10.740
Pandora, you must protect
the soul of Lord Hades.

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.920
Until the time comes.

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:13.890
Time?

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:20.280
In the far east, 108 Specters, warriors
of the Underworld, will revive.

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:26.170
That's when Lord Hades will wage
the final holy war on earth.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:28.100
Do you understand, Pandora?

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:33.640
You are given the power
to lead the 108 Specters.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.150
Until that time comes,

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:38.950
take good care of Lord Hades.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:45.700
If you do so, you will be
awarded eternal life. Eternal.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:56.140
Soon after, my mother gave birth
to my little brother, Lord Hades.

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:01.690
Since that day, all living things
in the Heinstein house except me

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.640
died with no explanation.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.610
Humans and animals,

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:08.960
even the plant life.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:13.710
The dying castle was surrounded
by Lord Hades' barrier

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.600
so no one could approach it.

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:19.790
The Heinstein Castle would rob
all living things of life.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.090
It was the castle of death.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:24.070
It became the Hades Castle.

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.300
I see.

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:29.950
And so, in order to take over Hades' body,

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:33.270
you came looking for little Shun.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.070
Yes.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:39.980
I was told the one who was selected
to be the body of Hades was in Japan.

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:42.890
I was ordered by Thanatos and Hypnos.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:47.340
You, who are supposed to be loyal to Hades,

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.290
ask me to get revenge against him?

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.870
Have you gone mad, Pandora?

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.120
I told you.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.240
My eyes have been opened

00:07:56.840 --> 00:08:01.360
since you showed me a passion toward life,

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.090
whether I like it or not.

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:07.620
Ever since I was three,
I lived as Hades' sister.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.880
No, as his slave.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:14.450
Everything looked so gray,

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:18.800
the color of the sky, grass and blood.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:22.280
After meeting all of you again in hell,

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.880
I started remembering

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:27.120
that the sky was blue and the grass was green

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:29.900
and blood is infinitely red.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:35.520
The Specters and I believed that
under the reign of Lord Hades

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:38.030
the tarnished Earth would
be turned into a utopia.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:40.290
And those who lived there

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.700
would be given eternal life.

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:48.240
But that was all an illusion.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:53.900
It's actually when all
life would be terminated.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.930
Just like my family.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:02.500
If you have this on, you can
go anywhere in the Underworld,

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:04.640
even other dimensions.

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:09.390
This is the one gift I
received from Lord Hades.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.700
If you give me this,

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.970
what will you do?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.630
What will I do?

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:19.600
I am basically a traitor.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.880
Hades, no.

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:25.480
Thanatos and Hypnos will not overlook this.

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:31.450
What happened, Pandora?

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.390
Don't worry about me.

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:36.280
Hurry to Elysion.

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:39.910
But don't forget this, Ikki.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.660
You must not let your guard down,

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:45.440
even if you defeat all 108 Specters.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:50.160
The most fearsome are the
two servants of Lord Hades,

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.670
Thanatos and Hypnos.

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:56.320
The big three are infants in comparison.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:10:03.110
It's because the two are Gods who
became the servants of Lord Hades.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:07.880
So, even when you are far away,

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:11.240
they can kill you if they wish to.

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:12.900
Like this.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:16.420
Ridiculous. Get a hold of yourself, Pandora.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.550
I'll heal you now.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.530
Phoenix!

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.440
Have you tricked Miss Pandora?

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:25.580
We cannot forgive a traitor!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:30.660
To realize Lord Hades' utopia
and to receive eternal life!

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:33.130
Utopia. Eternal life.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:34.650
You bastards.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.250
Do you honestly believe such things exist?

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:39.210
Die, Phoenix!

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:41.460
Flying Phoenix!

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:46.690
You, who have been manipulated by Hades...

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:55.380
Finally, all of Shaka's beads
changed the colors just now.

00:10:55.970 --> 00:11:00.080
That means all of the 108
Specters have been defeated.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:02.540
Pandora.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:19.930
Pandora, I will take on the
burden of your suffering.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:27.630
And I will smash Hades' treachery!

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:34.870
So, rest in peace, Pandora.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.620
Lord Thanatos, Lord Thanatos!

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:53.340
There's big trouble!

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:57.970
What's all the noise? Has Cupid
caused some mischief again?

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.120
No, Lord Thanatos.

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:04.680
There is someone covered
in blood, sweat and mud.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:06.210
Right over there.

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.280
What?

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:14.160
He looks like a demon from hell
who wandered into Elysion.

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:15.750
So terrifying.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.490
Where in Elysion is this?

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:21.820
Do you know Athena?

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:24.060
Where is Hades?

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:28.100
Have you seen a man named Shun
wearing a Cloth like mine?

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.530
Please. Tell me.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:33.820
Hey!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.190
You are annoying.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.820
You frightened the nymphs.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.640
This is Elysion, where only
good people can enter.

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:45.740
It's no surprise if they mistake you
for a demon in those dirtied garbs.

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:53.310
Thanks to you my darling nymphs
have stopped singing, frightened.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:54.950
You are?

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:56.940
I am Thanatos.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.190
Thanatos?

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.650
Why are your eyes and hair silver?

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.330
Are you a Specter?

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:07.310
I'm not a Specter.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:11.900
Since ancient times, I am the
trusted right hand of Lord Hades.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:15.270
I'm one of his closest aides.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:19.200
Aide? Then this should go quickly.

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:23.180
Where is Athena, who followed Hades here?

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.160
She died.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.560
What?

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:33.870
By now, my brother Hypnos is probably
offering her corpse to Lord Hades.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:37.510
No way! Don't lie! Where is Hades?

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:50.850
Fool.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:54.520
I don't have to answer all your questions.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:59.130
But to have gotten past the Wailing
Wall and across the other dimensions

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:02.650
and reach Elysion is a miracle.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.160
I applaud your loyalty to Athena.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:10.930
Die and go to where Athena lays.

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:11.860
Wait.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:15.300
Hypnos.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.980
Hypnos?

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.230
They must be twins.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.190
They're exactly alike.

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:24.470
No, there's a difference.

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:27.890
Hypnos's eyes and hair are gold.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:29.140
Thanatos.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:34.690
Since ancient times this has been revered
sacred grounds, never tarnished.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.860
If you soil it with the blood of a Saint,

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:40.570
how would you repent to Lord Hades?

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.080
Hypnos.

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:48.260
Then do you suggest we let
this Saint wreck this place?

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:51.270
That would tarnish Elysion even more.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:57.440
Thanatos, you take one's life too lightly.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:14:59.980
Why did you kill Pandora?

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.630
What did he say?

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:03.520
Pandora has been killed?

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.750
Why did I kill her?

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:09.220
Hypnos, you surely must know.

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.110
Pandora has betrayed Lord Hades

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:16.270
and lead the Phoenix Saint to Elysion.

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:18.940
Ikki!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:24.440
You can't get the smallest thing
past us in the Underworld.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:25.400
Exactly.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:31.680
However, Pandora, since a young
age has guarded Lord Hades' soul.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:35.390
So taking her life was unnecessary.

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:39.320
Especially now, with the 108 Specters gone,

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:41.410
Pandora will be missed.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.970
What is there to miss?

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:47.370
Pandora and the Specters
are slaves after all.

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:52.250
As long as we are here,
everything will be fine.

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:57.470
As proof, you captured and
killed Athena without trouble.

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.240
Isn't that right, Hypnos?

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:01.920
It's true, I captured Athena.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.340
But I haven't taken her life.

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:05.080
What?

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:09.810
No way! Why didn't you kill her immediately?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:15.040
Athena has infiltrated Elysion
intending to kill Lord Hades!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:16.630
I already told you.

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:21.720
This is sacred ground that has not
been tarnished since ancient times.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:26.450
Life and death decisions are
to be made only by Lord Hades.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.220
Then Athena is...

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:30.020
That's right.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.640
What about Athena?

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:35.280
Answer me. Where is Athena?

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:39.650
The temple in the distance.

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:46.270
It's where the true body of Lord Hades
has been asleep since ancient times.

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:47.190
What?

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:50.730
Athena is now also asleep in the temple.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:52.560
Asleep?

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.210
However, it's not an ordinary sleep.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.540
I put her to eternal sleep.

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:01.640
Eternal sleep?

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.200
That's right.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:09.100
Athena's body is trapped in
a legendary urn of Elysion.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:15.470
This urn can't be broken,
even by the might of Zeus.

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:18.310
Moreover, the urn sucks blood,

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:21.380
gradually turning the
pure white container red.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:26.020
When Athena's blood is sucked dry
and the urn becomes pure red,

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.350
Athena's life will be over.

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.730
Will Athena live or die?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:34.330
It is all up to Lord Hades.

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.730
I will save Athena's life,
even if it costs mine!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.390
Athena!

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:50.220
Hypnos, do you intend to just
observe Pegasus enter the temple?

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:54.210
Even if this place is soiled
with the blood of a Saint.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:57.060
I will kill him. All right?

00:17:57.250 --> 00:17:58.690
Do as you please.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:03.690
But, Thanatos, if you're
going to do it, do it right.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:08.300
Don't hesitate and tarnish
the Hades temple with blood.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:11.000
Have you gone mad, Hypnos?

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:16.160
What could go wrong when it's me
against a little Bronze Saint brat?

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.250
It'll be over before you can blink.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:23.260
Hey, look. This is the end for Pegasus.

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:26.180
What? What's that?

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:30.240
Take this, Thanatos!

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.460
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:34.660
Damn you!

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:37.780
Pegasus, you bastard!

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.740
That's why I warned you, Thanatos,

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:46.640
that Pegasus has the fearless will of
a warrior with nothing left to lose.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:51.840
Even you will have to give
it your all to take him down.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:55.890
Absurd. Don't underestimate me.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.570
Take this!

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:03.800
Fool! You can't run forever!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:16.140
Now your wings are completely broken.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.930
You can't escape anymore.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.950
Athena.

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:26.150
Sister.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.960
Athena's Saint, Pegasus.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.090
It was a needless worry.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:41.970
Damn! The sun will soon
be completely covered.

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:45.690
What are Seiya and the others doing?

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:50.200
Calm down. They are probably
busy fighting right now.

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:52.200
You guys must know.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:56.130
Exactly. We need to believe
and wait for their victory.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:58.310
By the way, Marin.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:02.280
Where were you hiding until now?

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:05.590
Seiya had been looking for you.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:09.910
I am not the one Seiya is really looking for.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:10.810
What?

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:12.190
Kiki.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.290
Right here.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:15.300
What?

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:17.370
This way.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.740
So beautiful.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:26.770
Marin, this girl?

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:29.620
The one Seiya has been looking for.

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:33.430
What? That means she is Seiya's...

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:37.420
Yes. Her name is Seika. She's Seiya's sister.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:40.040
Seiya's sister.

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:42.410
Seika.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.040
Take this!

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:55.170
Now, playtime is over.

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:58.650
I'll be merciful and finish you off, Pegasus.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:03.440
So it ends here.

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:04.860
Seiya.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:06.650
Seiya!

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.010
Athena.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.230
Seiya.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.520
Seiya!

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:14.620
This voice, I can't forget it.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:16.840
This voice...

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:18.970
This voice belongs to

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:23.630
my one and only!

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:30.100
What?

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:36.680
You still have the strength to get
up after taking all of those blows?

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:41.030
I can't die. I still can't die yet.

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:44.110
I still have something I have to do.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:46.560
I still have someone I want to see!

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:48.550
Die, Pegasus!

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:50.340
Burn!

00:21:50.340 --> 00:21:51.650
My Cosmo!

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:53.940
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:21:56.020 --> 00:21:59.090
Did you think you can defeat
me with that attack?

00:22:01.100 --> 00:22:04.450
What? Pegasus's meteors
are converging into one.

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:05.660
What's this attack?

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:09.990
Pegasus!

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:11.050
Pegasus!

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:13.290
Comet!

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:05.660
Is all my strength not
enough against them?

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.940
Is this truly the difference in strength between a God and a mortal?

00:24:09.200 --> 00:24:13.690
After I am broken mentally and physically, and
the darkness known as despair takes over me,

00:24:13.780 --> 00:24:15.990
the light of hope shines once again.

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:20.240
It goes beyond dimensions to save the people of Earth,

00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:23.270
and to lead us to victory.

00:24:23.780 --> 00:24:26.210
Saint Seiya: Golden Reinforcement.

00:24:26.490 --> 00:24:29.150
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
